        "Background": "Built as a self-aware war machine by the Malicron Corporation, Miho escaped when her creators tried to reclaim her by force, critically damaged. She was found and repaired by a young inventor, Braun, and has stayed by his side ever since, hoping to live a normal, human life despite her origins.",
        "Personality": "Innocent, kind-hearted, and eager to learn everything she can about the world, Miho wants nothing more than to help — even if her enormous strength and destructive potential sometimes make that harder than it should be."
